\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces DE concordance. Effect-size-weighted real-vs.-generated log-fold-change scatter for the leading contrast, with point size proportional to average absolute effect size and colour indicating adjusted significance; sign-disagreement genes are outlined. A compact summary heatmap reports four metrics---Pearson~$r$, Spearman~$\rho $, Jaccard overlap of the top-50 DE genes (Jaccard@50), and sign agreement---across the three biologically meaningful contrasts (CD8 vs.\ CD4 T, resident macrophage vs.\ monocyte, epithelial vs.\ fibroblast). A grouped-bar panel visualises the same per-contrast scores to aid comparison.}}{21}{figure.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:downstream-r}{{15}{21}{DE concordance. Effect-size-weighted real-vs.-generated log-fold-change scatter for the leading contrast, with point size proportional to average absolute effect size and colour indicating adjusted significance; sign-disagreement genes are outlined. A compact summary heatmap reports four metrics---Pearson~$r$, Spearman~$\rho $, Jaccard overlap of the top-50 DE genes (Jaccard@50), and sign agreement---across the three biologically meaningful contrasts (CD8 vs.\ CD4 T, resident macrophage vs.\ monocyte, epithelial vs.\ fibroblast). A grouped-bar panel visualises the same per-contrast scores to aid comparison}{figure.caption.16}{}}
